cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Knowledge Before Models: replication package"
message: >-
  If you use this material, please cite both the archived deposit
  and the article.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Dongjin
    family-names: Kim
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-6414-3477"
    affiliation: Korea Institute for Defense Analyses
abstract: >-
  Replication material for a study separating task-relative knowledge
  coverage from corpus size in air-gapped retrieval-augmented
  generation. Contains the evaluation pipeline, 122 hand-written
  evaluation questions over Korean defense acquisition law, per-condition
  model responses for 30 corpus conditions and three open-weight models,
  a closed-book control arm, grading output, and the analysis that
  produces every table and figure in the article.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - knowledge coverage
  - air-gapped AI
  - calibration
  - selective prediction
  - attribution
  - defense acquisition
